    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.quick-decision",
      "id": "quick-decision",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "直接判断：电话销售员用批准脚本通过电话说明产品、服务或捐赠请求，并准确记录回应和下一步。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "适合信号：能在重复沟通与拒绝中保持清晰、尊重停止联系要求，并逐项记录事实。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "谨慎条件：若容易夸大效果、跳过限制、替顾客作决定或为指标忽略拒接，应先做本页虚构分流练习。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.fermat-decision-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "安全试做只使用四条虚构记录，不拨号、不收款、不使用真实个人信息。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.quick-decision.fermat-decision-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.profile",
      "id": "profile",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "美国O*NET 2026年精确职业数据：本页对应41-9041.00，覆盖通过电话争取商品或服务订单，也可能请求捐赠。"
            ]
          },
          "fact_refs": [
            "identity",
            "work"
          ],
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.definition-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "onet"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "记录输入可包括经批准的名单、联系依据、脚本版本、产品或服务资料、价格限制、拒接状态和订单字段。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.responsibilities-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "可把官方任务整理为：联系对象、说明方案与价格、回答问题、记录回应、录入订单信息并安排后续。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.responsibilities-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.responsibilities-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              "可复核产出包括联系结果、问题与答复、订单或未成交原因、拒接状态、异常记录和下一步。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.responsibilities-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "list"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "关键判断记录应区分联系依据、脚本状态、信息缺口、停止点，以及价格、付款或投诉的升级状态。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.work-context-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.work-context-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "流程可整理为：核名单和版本→确认对象→完成披露与问答→记录回应→复核订单或拒接→交接异常。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.work-context-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.onet-structured-fields-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "求职时可核实雇主实际使用的电话系统、客户关系管理系统、批准脚本、订单系统和拒接名单。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.onet-structured-fields-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "交接记录可区分销售主管、产品或服务、客户服务、合规、订单履行和付款等责任接口；实际边界按雇主流程核实。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.career-quick-answers-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-quick-answers-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "质量记录应使对象、时间、依据、脚本版本、陈述、回应、同意、拒接、订单状态和异常可追溯。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.career-quick-answers-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.definition-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "边界记录应明确不扩大名单、不绕过拒接、不改价格限制，也不在授权不清时收集付款信息。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.profile.definition-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
