    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.ai-impact",
      "id": "ai-impact",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "AI可辅助整理名单、生成批准脚本草稿、提示缺失字段和汇总通话记录。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "采用前要限定输入数据、批准语料、访问权限、发送权限、人工复核和撤回流程。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "名单与通话记录可能含个人信息，访问、保留、删除和导出范围必须明确。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "人类复核联系依据、拒接状态、脚本版本、价格、限制、顾客原话和订单字段。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "最终拨号、关键陈述、付款处理、投诉处置和异常升级由有权人员决定。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "错误画像、虚构偏好、遗漏拒接或自动发送会伤害消费者并制造合规风险。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "任务暴露、工具采用、生产率和净就业变化是不同问题，不能从生成脚本推导岗位消失。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.7",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.ai-impact-table",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "先在虚构名单和不发送的草稿环节测试，记录错误后再决定是否扩大。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.ai-impact.ai-impact-table.8",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
