              "能在重复通话后仍准确记录对象、时间、回应和下一步。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.fit.riasec-fit-block.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.riasec-fit-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "若喜欢沟通但讨厌记录，应通过样本验证而不是凭兴趣判断。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.fit.riasec-fit-block.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.riasec-fit-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "若为促成交易容易夸大效果或跳过限制，应比较责任边界更合适的方向。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.fit.riasec-fit-block.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.riasec-fit-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "高频拒绝、时段要求和绩效节奏需要情绪稳定与优先级管理。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.fit.riasec-fit-block.7",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.riasec-fit-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "人格或兴趣量表只用于提问，最终看工作样本、学习速度与真实绩效。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.fit.riasec-fit-block.8",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.risk",
      "id": "risk",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-risk-cards",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "美国FTC现行指南精确规则范围（2026-09-06访问）：美国FTC指南提示电话营销需关注披露、误导、呼叫时段、拒接、付款授权和记录；适用范围与例外由具体活动和法域决定。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.risk.career-risk-cards.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-risk-cards",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "名单联系依据不清或对象已有拒接标记时，不拨号并保留原始状态。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.risk.career-risk-cards.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-risk-cards",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "脚本、价格、产品限制或付款授权不清时，停止陈述或交易并交给相应责任人。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.risk.career-risk-cards.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-risk-cards",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "不要把沉默、含糊回应或历史购买自动解释为当前同意。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.risk.career-risk-cards.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-risk-cards",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "共同升级规则：记录已知事实、对象、时间、版本、当前状态和待决问题，再交给主管、合规、客服或付款责任人。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.risk.career-risk-cards.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "availability": "available",
      "content_state": "enhanced",
      "copy_key": "career.block.path",
      "id": "path",
      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "现实入口可从名单核对、脚本演练、受监督通话、订单录入、拒接维护和质量抽查开始。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "雇主证据应展示名单分流、批准脚本、两组问答、订单字段、拒接处理和通话复盘。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "虚构材料：A名单依据已批准、脚本v3、无拒接、10:30；B明确要求不再联系；C名单依据缺失；D名单批准但脚本仍为v2。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "分流规则：名单依据已批准、当地允许时段、无拒接且脚本为v3才可进入演练；拒接者排除；依据或版本缺失者暂停。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "独立推演：A进入不拨号演练，B排除，C与D暂停；总计一条进入、一条排除、两条暂停，共四条。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "可用同一虚构材料分步练习名单分流、脚本、模拟问答、结果录入、拒接与版本检查、交接和错误复盘；七日只是建议节奏，不是能力或录用保证。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "培训结业和岗位名称不自动授予名单联系、价格变更、付款处理或法域许可。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.7",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "成长从准确分流和受监督沟通，推进到复杂问答、质量抽查和流程改进，不承诺固定晋升年限。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.path.career-path-block.8",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial",
            "ftc"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
    },
