          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "美国2024—2034年电话销售员41-9041.00精确职业数据：就业由67,400人预计降至52,500人，下降22%。"
            ]
          },
          "fact_refs": [
            "employment"
          ],
          "id": "telemarketers.market-signals.market-signal-card.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "trend"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.market-signal-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "在同一2024—2034年美国电话销售员精确职业数据中，年均约有6,500个职位空缺，包含增长和替补需求。"
            ]
          },
          "fact_refs": [
            "employment"
          ],
          "id": "telemarketers.market-signals.market-signal-card.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "trend"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.market-signal-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "下降与年均空缺可同时存在，不能把空缺当净新增，也不能推导个人录用概率。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.market-signals.market-signal-card.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.market-signal-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "招聘样本只能说明采集日期、地区、行业、经验带、薪酬结构和去重后的岗位组合。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.market-signals.market-signal-card.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.market-signal-card",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "转向其他方向时，应分别核实新岗位的对象、工具和责任证据。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "telemarketers.market-signals.market-signal-card.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
